'''Jumbo Invasion''' (ジャンボーグ鈴木大降臨, ''Janbōgu Suzuki Daikōrin'', '''Jumborg Suzuki Great Advent''') is a [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stage]] that was added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]] and appears on '''5th''', '''6th''', '''19th''' and '''20th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3. The first three stages yield nothing when completed, while the final stage drops the unit [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]].

