==Trivia==
*Jumbo Invasion has similarities to each of the three [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stages]] released before it:
**[[Aqua Saint Climax (Brutal)|Aqua Saint Climax]] has "Climax" in its name like [[Reign of the Tyrant]]'s [[Infernal Tyrant Climax (Brutal)|Infernal Tyrant Climax]].
**Jumbo Invasion has "Invasion" in its name like [[Invasion of the Swamplord]].
**Jumbo Invasion's event poster says, "The hunt is on!" like [[Hunt for the Xenobeast]]'s [[Media:Eve l 169 en.png|event poster]].

